{"map":{"id":"abbey.hall","name":{"en":"The Chapter Hall","zh":"骑士团大厅"},"region":"frostfang","kind":"interior","width":28,"height":20,"rows":["VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVXXXXXXXXXXXXXVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVXFFFFFFFFFFFXVVVVVVVV","VXXXXXXXFFFFFFFFFFFXXXXXXXXV","VXFFFFFXFFFFFFFFFFFXFFFFFFXV","VXFFFFFXFFFFcccFFFFXFFFFFFXV","VXFFFFFFFFFFcccFFFFFFFFFFFXV","VXFFFFFXFFFFcccFFFFXFFFFFFXV","VXFFFFFXFFFFcccFFFFXFFFFFFXV","VXXFFFFXFFFFcccFFFFXFFFFFFXV","VXXXXXXXFFFFcccFFFFXXXXXXXXV","VVVVVVVXXXXXFFFXXXXXVVVVVVVV","VVVVVVVVVVVXXDXXVVVVVVVVVVVV"],"portals":[{"x":13,"y":19,"to":"abbey","tx":6,"ty":12,"label":{"en":"Abbey of the Thorn","zh":"荆棘修道院"}}],"stamps":[{"key":"abhall_shell@8","x":7,"y":1},{"key":"abhall_shell@9","x":7,"y":3},{"key":"abhall_shell@10","x":0,"y":3},{"key":"abhall_shell@11","x":0,"y":5},{"key":"abhall_shell@12","x":0,"y":7},{"key":"abhall_shell@13","x":0,"y":8},{"key":"abhall_shell@14","x":0,"y":13},{"key":"abhall_shell@15","x":0,"y":14},{"key":"abhall_shell@16","x":0,"y":15},{"key":"abhall_shell@17","x":0,"y":16},{"key":"abhall_shell@18","x":6,"y":17},{"key":"abhall_shell@19","x":10,"y":18},{"key":"decor_stones@0","x":9,"y":16},{"key":"decor_bones@0","x":17,"y":15},{"key":"decor_sacks@shadow","x":2,"y":14},{"key":"decor_sacks@0","x":2,"y":15}],"rooms":[{"style":"shell","x":1,"y":10,"w":7,"h":8},{"style":"shell","x":7,"y":8,"w":13,"h":11},{"style":"shell","x":19,"y":10,"w":8,"h":8}],"regions":{"cell":[20,11,6,6]},"music":"dungeon","light":"indoor","zone":"combat"},"entities":[{"id":"abbey.hall~1","type":"fixture/furniture/table","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":13,"y":11},"name":{"en":"The Roll of the Order","zh":"骑士团名册"},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"The knights of the Order, forty-one names in forty-one hands. The last is written larger, the ink still black: ALBERIC, KNIGHT-COMMANDER — BEARER OF THE CROWN. HE HOLDS FOR US ALL. No knight was made after him; the rest of the page is empty.","text_zh":"骑士团的骑士名录，四十一个名字，四十一种笔迹。最后一个写得大些，墨色还是黑的：阿尔贝里克，骑士长，持冠者。他为我等众人坚守。他之后再无人受封，这一页剩下的地方都空着。"}},{"id":"abbey.hall~2","type":"fixture/furniture/chair","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":11,"y":11}},{"id":"abbey.hall~3","type":"fixture/furniture/chair","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":15,"y":11}},{"id":"abbey.hall~4","type":"fixture/light/brazier","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":8,"y":9},"statuses":{"lit":-1}},{"id":"abbey.hall~5","type":"fixture/light/brazier","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":18,"y":9},"statuses":{"lit":-1}},{"id":"abbey.hall~6","type":"fixture/container/bookshelf","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":10,"y":9},"name":{"en":"The Order's books","zh":"骑士团的书"}},{"id":"abbey.hall~7","type":"fixture/furniture/rack","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":16,"y":9},"name":{"en":"Empty weapon racks","zh":"空了的兵器架"}},{"id":"abbey.hall~cg","type":"actor/creature/undead/skeleton","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":13,"y":14},"facing":"down","ai":{"behaviour":"melee","temper":"aggressive","sight":4,"home":{"map":"abbey.hall","x":13,"y":14},"leash":6}},{"id":"abbey.hall~e","type":"fixture/furniture/table","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":4,"y":13},"name":{"en":"The scriptorium desk","zh":"缮写室书桌"}},{"type":"item/document/writ_of_relief","id":"abbey.hall~if","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":4,"y":14}},{"id":"abbey.hall~8","type":"fixture/furniture/bed","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":25,"y":12},"name":{"en":"Alberic's cot","zh":"阿尔贝里克的小床"}},{"id":"abbey.hall~9","type":"fixture/furniture/table","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":22,"y":14},"name":{"en":"Alberic's desk","zh":"阿尔贝里克的书桌"}},{"type":"item/document/letter","name":{"en":"Alberic's Journal, Leaf I","zh":"阿尔贝里克的日记·第一页"},"props":{"text":"I. Mended the miller's girl's kite today. She told me knights do not mend kites. I told her this one does. — A.","text_zh":"一。今天替磨坊主家的小姑娘补好了风筝。她说骑士是不补风筝的。我说，这个骑士补。——阿"},"id":"abbey.hall~ia","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":21,"y":13}},{"type":"item/document/letter","name":{"en":"Alberic's Journal, Leaf II","zh":"阿尔贝里克的日记·第二页"},"props":{"text":"II. They have chosen me for the Crown. The Prior says it is an honour. My brother Hugh says it is a sentence. Forty years, and then I am to be relieved. I can hold for forty years. — A.","text_zh":"二。他们选了我戴冠。院长说这是荣耀，我兄弟休说这是刑罚。四十年，期满就有人来接替。四十年，我守得住。——阿"},"id":"abbey.hall~ib","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":23,"y":13}},{"type":"item/document/letter","name":{"en":"Alberic's Journal, Leaf III","zh":"阿尔贝里克的日记·第三页"},"props":{"text":"III. The forty-first year. No one has come. The thorns are into the bone now. Today I could not remember Hugh's face, and I wept, and then I could not remember why I wept. — A.","text_zh":"三。第四十一年。没有人来。荆棘已经扎进骨头里了。今天我想不起休的长相，哭了一场，哭完又想不起自己为什么哭。——阿"},"id":"abbey.hall~ic","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":21,"y":15}},{"type":"item/document/letter","name":{"en":"Alberic's Journal, Leaf IV","zh":"阿尔贝里克的日记·第四页"},"props":{"text":"IV. Hold. Hold. Hold. Hold until relieved. Hold. Hold. Hold. Hold.","text_zh":"四。守住。守住。守住。守到有人来接替。守住。守住。守住。守住。"},"id":"abbey.hall~id","place":{"on":"tile","map":"abbey.hall","x":23,"y":15}}]}